description: {{ (wm.name ~ " (" ~ inv ~ ") is this project's development front door: briefing, start or resume work, remember a project fact, goals and metrics. Use only when the operator addresses " ~ wm.name ~ " by name or types " ~ inv ~ "; do not trigger on the bare verbs make, build or fix.") | tojson }}
